Z||000000||bond007||04-05-99||07:50 AM||||Where can I get a re build kit for this engine (besides the Fiero store, or the stroker kit that others sell)? I just want to up the compression to 10:1 & add a semi hot cam. Should I just go with seperate parts from TRW , Sealed Power & such???<p>Will tihs adversely affect my computer? I wan to get the Hyper Chip also.<p>Thanks<p>John<br>
Z||000001||Shaun41178||04-05-99||02:17 PM||||If all you want to do is up the compression and add a bigger cam then I suggest buying the parts separately.  It will most likely be cheaper going this route then buying a whole kit.  How much hp are you looking to get?  I can help with part numbers if you need some.
Z||000002||Punkndrublic||04-06-99||11:25 PM||||I had a custom cam made when I had my engine rebuilt all it did was move the powerband band up a bit, which of course kinda sucks with the stock ignition( the spark is gets real weak at bout 4500 or so) but if you race around all the time and keep it reving high like I do its a lot of fun  :-)
